@startuml analysis_flow
skinparam activityFontSize 13

|用户/管理员|
start
:在比赛详情页点击"态势分析";

|#LightBlue|系统|
:加载比赛完整数据;
:SituationAnalysisAgent.analyze();

|#LightBlue|数据采集|
:DataCollectAgent.collect();
:从事件重算比分和统计;
:生成结构化数据摘要;

|#LightBlue|远程AI调用|
:RemoteModelAgent 调用 DeepSeek API;

if (AI调用成功?) then (是)
    |#LightBlue|SSE流式输出|
    :Flux 接收文本流;
    :SSE 实时推送到前端;
    :前端渲染 Markdown;
else (否)
    |#LightBlue|策略模式降级|
    :AnalysisStrategyFactory 选择策略;
    switch (赛事类型)
    case (篮球)
        :BasketballAnalysis;
    case (足球)
        :FootballAnalysis;
    case (排球)
        :VolleyballAnalysis;
    case (通用)
        :GeneralAnalysis;
    endswitch
endif

|用户/管理员|
:查看态势分析报告;
stop
@enduml
